              "Drives the by-category Impact Table: what each category captures, the editable minutes band, the",
              "value outcome and the benchmark source. Relates to 'Activity Events'[Work Category]."
            ],
            "sourceColumn": "[Work Category]",
            "sortByColumn": "Sort Order",
